#..............#
#.P..,....r..P.#
#......s.......#
#P..........,.P#
#..,.....l.....#
#P.....==.....P#
#PP....==....PP#
#PPP...==...PPP#
#######==#######
place REG_CABIN 10 5
place REG_FROZEN_WELL 3 5
warp 7 13 MARKET 8 9 up
warp 8 13 MARKET 8 9 up
